# A mod that makes for clients download modpacks easy!
If you install that mod, in your main screen in minecraft you will see a button to download a mods from curseforge and modrinth.

You paste an JSON code and the ✨magic starts.✨

The json file structure is simple, for example:


```
{
  "mods": [
    {"project_id":"328085","version":"7408951","isModrinth":false},
    {"project_id":"LNytGWDc","version":"n7NADxiG","isModrinth":true}
  ]
}
```

Then you paste that to the Field and click ⬇️Download⬇️. Next the mod will download mods that you described in json into your mods folder. Then just restart the Minecraft and enjoy easy modpack config.
